						 <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/foundation-tales">Tales Hub</a> &#187; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/series-archive">Series Archive</a> &#187; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/acidverse">Acidverse</a> &#187; Cool War 2: Ruiz From Your Grave</p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/cool-war-4-hub">Cool War 4: Remnants Of Zmurgath's Cave</a> &#187; Cool War 2: Ruiz From Your Grave</p> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <blockquote> <p>&gt;unzip C00L_war_2_ru1z_fr0m_y0ur_gr4ve.7z<br /> Extracting 232 Files&#8230;<br /> Extracted!<br /> &gt;del C00L_war_2_ru1z_fr0m_y0ur_gr4ve.7z<br /> Deleting&#8230; Deleted!<br /> &gt;dir<br /> &gt; 001. Cool War: Death &amp; Rebirth (Summary)<br /> &gt; 002. The Dawn Of A New Era<br /> &gt; 003. Where Fearful Feet Dare Not Tread<br /> &gt; 004. <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/wowwee-un-kill-ursefl">wowwee un kill ursefl</a><br /> &gt; 005. Deconstruction Of A God<br /> &gt; 006. <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/fifty-percent-off-everything">Fifty Percent Off Everything</a><br /> &gt; 007. The Snipper Reborn<br /> &gt; 008. <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/joey-and-overgang-and-rita-and-molly-and-zombies">Joey And Overgang And Rita And Molly And Zombies</a><br /> &gt; 009. You Did What?<br /> &gt; 010. <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/noxious-fumes-fill-the-area">Noxious Fumes Fill The Area</a><br /> &gt; 011. Potential Tradeoffs<br /> &gt; 012. <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-second-cool-war-begins">The Second Cool War Begins</a><br /> &gt; 013. I Can See The Light<br /> &gt; 014. The Madness Sets In Fast<br /> &gt; 015. Antidisestablishmentarianism<br /> &gt; 016. Pork Crackling Is Repulsive<br /> &gt; 017. The Characteristic Dipole<br /> &gt; 018. Messages Transmitted And Recieved<br /> &gt; 019. Anusparade Assholes<br /> &gt; 020. A Series Of Changes<br /> &gt; 021. A Broken Bookshelf<br /> &gt; 022. Raptor Orgies Are More Fun Than You'd Think<br /> &gt; 023. But Less Than You'd Hope<br /> &gt; 024. Actually A Lot Les