&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607070073&quot; alt=&quot;MaliceAforethought&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902864)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought&quot;  &gt;MaliceAforethought&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-678667-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Wait to make sure your article&#039;s staying in the positive ratings (remaining at +1 or above for 24 hours) before adding the Task Force here: it&#039;s a pain to go through and clean up afterwards.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-678667-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. If applicable, have a link here to the specific entry on the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces&quot;&gt;canon list&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-678667-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. For &#039;canon&#039; task forces, or those with individual hub pages, just include a link. Hubs take priority over the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces&quot;&gt;canon list&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-678667-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Feel free to write whatever here if it&#039;s your MTF, but try to keep it fairly unobjectionable if it&#039;s not. It&#039;s not mandatory, but something more detailed than &amp;quot;SCP-specific Task Force&amp;quot; would be nice!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-678667-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Clowns. They hunt Clowns.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-678667-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Ideatic unit representing an item within the confines of a language, analogous to a linguistic meme.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
