d>MTF-Kappa-26</td> <td>Kappa Zulu</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-2511">SCP-2511</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Kappa-28</td> <td>School's Out</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4081">SCP-4081</a></td> <td>Specialized in the neutralization and containment of anomalies in learning institutions.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Kappa-29</td> <td>Killjoys</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4124">SCP-4124</a>, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/grape-flavored-cigars-and-funeral-pyres">Grape Flavored Cigars and Funeral Pyres</a></td> <td>Specializes in raids on conventions in the anomalous world that feature many civilians. Examples of such conventions: MC&amp;D Auctions, Anartist Showrooms, and CotBG, Sarkic, Fifthist, etc. religous gatherings.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Kappa-34</td> <td>Freud's Impressionable Students</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-4824">SCP-4824</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Kappa-71</td> <td>Roberto's Rules of Order</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1377">SCP-1377</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Kappa-101</td> <td>Convoy</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1401">SCP-1401</a></td> <td>SCP-specific task force.</td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">▷&nbsp;Show&nbsp;list&nbsp;for&nbsp;'Lambda'</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">◁&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;list</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <td>MTF-Lambda-1</td> <td>Lethe</td> <td><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/class-a-orange-65">Class-A Orange 65</a></td> <td>Specializes in field amnestics administration.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>MTF-Lambda-1</td> <td>Maxwel