&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/lilies&quot;&gt;Lilies&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;Eighteen days later, as both Kyōko and Yuriko met over drinks, neither quite looking other in the eye, the lilies in both condominiums wilted and faded. Spring had come early, the next year, the third of March.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Amelia Wright.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/flotsam&quot;&gt;flotsam&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;This can&#039;t be all there is.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by UraniumEmpire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/chapter-3-a-face-too-young-to-be-mine&quot;&gt;A Face Too Young To Be Mine&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;Several agents had aimed their guns at the black-furred form of the Goatman, who was carrying a woman in her thirties on his back, her leg at a bizarre angle.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Ihp.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/puffy&quot;&gt;Puffy&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt; I saw some weird, sick homeless guy with a messed-up face on the road, and I drove the hell away.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Dr Gears.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/sariling-dugo-t-bakal&quot;&gt;Sariling Dugo&#039;t Bakal&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;At the corner of my eye, I see Vincent, with his big dumb smile and three cups of halo-halo.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by basirskipreader.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/nineeightnineninenine&quot;&gt;NINEEIGHTNINENINENINE&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;Oh, that&#039;s my new name. I&#039;m Veronica Fitzroy, now.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by UraniumEmpire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/chapter-2-i-don-t-want-to-set-the-world-on-fire&quot;&gt;I Don&#039;t Want To Set The World On Fire…&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;Drew the short straw in your absence, Carol. One of the washers at the Laundr-O-Matic tried to eat someone, we&#039;re to handle it. Toff, you&#039;re with Grey— spectral disturbance at the Wal-Mart.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Ihp.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/chapter-1-off-the-road-off-the-rails&quot;&gt;Off the Road, Off the Rails&lt;/a&gt; - //&amp;quot;Like… I&#039;m expecting him to walk in at any moment, sit by that bed, and maybe read the Bible and pray for h-his recovery.&lt;/em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Ihp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/poison-apples&quot;&gt;Poison Apples&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;Mom arranged another tutor for me. This time it&#039;s for Social Studies. This makes four tutors now&lt;/em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by theinuite.&lt;/li&gt;
